Register QOracle in the MQT Core compiler

Adds the QOracle dialect to the compiler context, registers the QOracle passes
and the QOracle-to-QC conversion in `mqt-core compile`, and links the QOracle
libraries into the core targets that need them. The linked targets are defined
by the mqt-core-qoracle project, so this patch only builds inside it.

